# Do NOT add `#!include:.gitignore` here, and do not delete this file.
# gcloud only auto-generates a .gcloudignore (which pulls in .gitignore) when
# none exists. .gitignore excludes agents/*/.env, which are NOT optional -- they
# carry GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT and the sub-agent engine IDs, and the tools raise at
# import without them. Excluding them from the build context ships agents that
# deploy fine and then fail to start. The cloudbuilds assert they are present.

.git/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.bak.*
**/*.bak.*
*.pptx
*.docx
viewer/node_modules/
viewer/dist/
